.* QUIIPLA: DSPIPLA, the IPL attributes by section. The empty :DATACOL.
.* puts the colon at column 52 as the golden has it.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=VALCL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=RESTART CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=KEYLCKPOS CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=HDWDIAG CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=CPRJOBTBL CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=CHKJOBTBL CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=RBDPRDDIR CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=MSFRCY CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DSPSTS CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=STRTCP CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=SPLFRCY CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=CLRJOBQ CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=CLROUTQ CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=CLRINCJOB CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=STRPRTWTR CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=STRRSTD CLASS=VALCL.
:KEYL NAME=DSPKEYS HELP=KEYSHLP.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPIPLA HELP=HLPIPLA KEYL=DSPKEYS ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display IPL Attributes
:DATA DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES.
:DATACOL WIDTH=51.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.System Features
:DATAI VAR=RESTART USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RESTART'.Restart type
:DATAI VAR=KEYLCKPOS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/KEYLCKPOS'.Keylock position
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=SPACE.Hardware Functions
:DATAI VAR=HDWDIAG USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/HDWDIAG'.Hardware diagnostics
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=SPACE.Operating System Functions
:DATAI VAR=CPRJOBTBL USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/CPRJOBTBL'.Compress job tables
:DATAI VAR=CHKJOBTBL USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/CHKJOBTBL'.Check job tables
:DATAI VAR=RBDPRDDIR USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RBDPRDDIR'.Rebuild product directory
:DATAI VAR=MSFRCY USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/MSFRCY'.Mail Server Framework recovery
:DATAI VAR=DSPSTS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DSPSTS'.Display status
:DATAI VAR=STRTCP USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/STRTCP'.Start TCP/IP
:DATAI VAR=SPLFRCY USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/SPLFRCY'.Spooled file recovery
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAC.
:DATAC.
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=SPACE.Operating System Options
:DATAI VAR=CLRJOBQ USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/CLRJOBQ'.Clear job queues
:DATAI VAR=CLROUTQ USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/CLROUTQ'.Clear output queues
:DATAI VAR=CLRINCJOB USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/CLRINCJOB'.Clear incomplete joblogs
:DATAI VAR=STRPRTWTR USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/STRPRTWTR'.Start print writers
:DATAI VAR=STRRSTD USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/STRRSTD'.Start system to restricted state
:EDATAGRP.
:EDATA.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPIPLA.Display IPL Attributes - Help
:P.What the next IPL does: how far it restarts, which tables it checks,
and what the operating system starts or clears on the way up. CHGIPLA
changes them.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=KEYSHLP.Function keys - Help
:P.F3 and F12 leave, F5 reads the attributes again.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='FLD/RESTART'.Restart type
:P.The restart type shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/KEYLCKPOS'.Keylock position
:P.The keylock position shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/HDWDIAG'.Hardware diagnostics
:P.The hardware diagnostics shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/CPRJOBTBL'.Compress job tables
:P.The compress job tables shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/CHKJOBTBL'.Check job tables
:P.The check job tables shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/RBDPRDDIR'.Rebuild product directory
:P.The rebuild product directory shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/MSFRCY'.Mail Server Framework recovery
:P.The mail Server Framework recovery shown for what the display is
about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DSPSTS'.Display status
:P.The display status shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/STRTCP'.Start TCP/IP
:P.The start TCP/IP shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/SPLFRCY'.Spooled file recovery
:P.The spooled file recovery shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/CLRJOBQ'.Clear job queues
:P.The clear job queues shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/CLROUTQ'.Clear output queues
:P.The clear output queues shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/CLRINCJOB'.Clear incomplete joblogs
:P.The clear incomplete joblogs shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/STRPRTWTR'.Start print writers
:P.The start print writers shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/STRRSTD'.Start system to restricted state
:P.The start system to restricted state shown for what the display is
about.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
